{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/819706-lady-in-the-water-as-changeling-game","id":819706,"title":"'Lady in the Water' as Changeling game","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Changeling: The Lost"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-01-29T23:09:37-08:00","id":819706,"title":"'Lady in the Water' as Changeling game","content":"Watched today <a href=\"https://youtu.be/j13OAJzdtqg\" target=\"_blank\">Nostalgia Critic review</a> of this movie and it sounds totally as <b>Changeling</b> story ( well, beside M. Night Shyamalan auto critic subplots ). There is strange being, people touched by quirks and those pointing to their greater symbology. Main character is calling herself &quot;Story&quot;. ( Wyrd, anyone? ) Their are even (literal) Briarwolves! It's a mine of <b>Changeling</b> tropes.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 01-30-2016, 02:12 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-29T23:59:10-08:00","id":819717,"title":"","content":"If the entire movie is actually taking place inside Arcadia with all the human actors being captured humans forced to play-act for the pleasure of their Keepers, that... explains a lot, actually. It also explains why genderbent Rufio is apparently in this story. ,.. though I suppose that could also be explained as, &quot;everything changed when the Fire Nation attacked.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Hige sceal \u00fe\u0113 heardra, heorte \u00fe\u0113 c\u0113nre,<br /> m\u014dd sceal \u00fe\u0113 m\u0101re, \u00fe\u0113 \u016bre m\u00e6gen lytla\u00f0.</i>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8950-vithrir","name":"Vithrir","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8950_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"130"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T12:55:19-08:00","id":819928,"title":"","content":"Oh man, M. Night Shyamalan as one of the Keepers... a scary thought indeed.<br /> <br /> &quot;He was messing with my head from day one... even convinced me at one point that I was dead and had actually been a ghost since I arrived in Arcadia. Later I found a mentor who helped me cope with the strangeness, someone I thought was a fellow captive, but it turned out that he was just my keeper again, trying to shape me into the protagonist of a story of his own making.<br /> <br /> Then things started getting <i>really</i> weird.<br /> <br /> I remember being attacked by menacing, half-seen entities who ultimately turned out to be pathetic little trolls who couldn't open doors or abide the touch of water. Later, I was in some kind of village menaced by monsters who hated the color red, only to find out they were just humans in costumes... or something. Honestly, I'm not really even sure what was going on with the girl who came out of the swimming pool.<br /> <br /> And then one day all the people who I was pretty sure had also been captive humans started committing suicide. I remember one of them ranting that the plants were forcing them to do it, though all the plants I saw turned out to be inert plastic. After that it sort of felt like my Keeper just gave up, and took to just sort of sitting with me while he delivered long-winded lectures about avatars and fire nations and nonsense like that. At that point I knew that I had to get away, and if I died in the attempt, well... at least the torture would be over.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3209,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","user":"CatDoom","date":". 01-30-2016, 03:59 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3209-catdoom","name":"CatDoom","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"370"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-01-30T20:51:34-08:00","id":820126,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-lost/819706-lady-in-the-water-as-changeling-game#post819706\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Watched today <a href=\"https://youtu.be/j13OAJzdtqg\" target=\"_blank\">Nostalgia Critic review</a> of this movie and it sounds totally as <b>Changeling</b> story ( well, beside M. Night Shyamalan auto critic subplots ). There is strange being, people touched by quirks and those pointing to their greater symbology. Main character is calling herself &quot;Story&quot;. ( Wyrd, anyone? ) Their are even (literal) Briarwolves! It's a mine of <b>Changeling</b> tropes.</div> </div> </div> </div>Actually, the critic could be an example of a low-Clarity Elemental.<br /> <br /> He's lost so much of his grip on reality he's not sure where the story ends and the life begins, or even if they were that different.<br /> <br /> So, when the wolves come, he recognizes his part was always to die for some sense of catharsis, and gladly accepts it. This is his life. This is his story. This is his home.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}